      "feedback": "自动测试：11/15。\n用例 a3，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 alarmAcked, alarmActive。\n用例 a7，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 alarmActive, highHigh。\n用例 alarm-edge-5，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 alarmAcked, alarmActive, highHigh。\n用例 alarm-edge-6，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 alarmAcked, alarmActive, highHigh。\nLTL 检查：not_run。\nObserved execution (no expected values or test notes):\n{\"failed_case\": \"a3\", \"mode\": \"sequence\", \"prefix_omitted\": false, \"input_trace\": [{\"case\": \"a1\", \"inputs\": {\"flowLow\": false, \"ackBtn\": false, \"sensorOK\": true}, \"const_inputs\": {}, \"initial_interface_values\": {}, \"cycles\": 1, \"scan_interval_ms\": null}, {\"case\": \"a2\", \"inputs\": {\"flowLow\": true, \"ackBtn\": false, \"sensorOK\": true}, \"const_inputs\": {}, \"initial_interface_values\": {}, \"cycles\": 1, \"scan_interval_ms\": null}, {\"case\": \"a3\", \"inputs\": {\"flowLow\": true, \"ackBtn\": true, \"sensorOK\": true}, \"const_inputs\": {}, \"initial_interface_values\": {}, \"cycles\": 1, \"scan_interval_ms\": null}], \"observed_outputs\": {\"alarmAcked\": false, \"alarmActive\": true}}",
